-- test: a `start` that moves a reply right under a `secret` program counter is U4003 at the `start`, since whether the host answers for its task would reveal the condition (spec/31 §1, ADR 0123 IF6); in a program that starts tasks, the check point that `secret` data decide there is also U4002 (spec/27 §8 rule 5, #1684)
-- spec: spec/31 §1
-- expect: error U4003 at src/srv.una:16:9
-- expect: error U4002 at src/srv.una:16:15
module srv

import std.host (Exchange)

idle(exchange: internal Exchange) -> Unit = unit

pub serve_all(exchanges: internal List[Exchange], key: secret Int) -> Unit
=
  tasks
    for exchange in exchanges
      if key > 0
        start idle(exchange)
      else
        unit
